{"availability":"available","full":"adimalkar/multimodal-fraud-detector","name":"multimodal-fraud-detector","description":"Multi-agent AI pipeline that detects generative-AI fraud in insurance claims across images, PDFs, and video. A \"Jury System\" of Qwen-VL vision analysis plus DeepSeek-R1/Qwen/GLM critic agents with majority voting — dashcam-aware, batch-capable, Streamlit UI.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-01T00:48:04Z","updated":"2026-10-08T06:06:15Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://frontend-adimalkars-projects.vercel.app","topics":["ai-agents","computer-vision","deep-learning","deepseek","forensic-analysis","fraud-detection","insurance","llm","multimodal","qwen-vl","streamlit"],"demo":"https://frontend-adimalkars-projects.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:45.746Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:45.746Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:45.746Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:45.746Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["FraudSight AI is an in-progress visual evidence screening application for images, PDFs, and videos. The backend samples bounded visual inputs, sends one request to an OpenRouter vision model, and combines its provisional result with extracted metadata. A model verdict is not proof of AI generation or insurance fraud; every result requires human review.","The opt-in durable backend has zero-model-call image provenance and PDF structure paths. The new PDF signature path adds offline integrity and revision observations. Each path explicitly abstains on AI-generation and fraud classification; see image evidence, PDF structure evidence, and PDF signature evidence. These paths are not automatically active on the public site.","The repository includes a Next.js frontend, a FastAPI backend, optional object storage, and PostgreSQL or SQLite persistence. OpenRouter calls are billed even when the hosting tier is free."],"features":["Default model: google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it through OpenRouter. OPENROUTERVISIONMODEL accepts only the low-cost allowlist in backend/qwenagent.py.","One model request per item: Up to one resized image, three rendered PDF pages, or three sampled video frames. A PDF exceeding three pages is rejected.","Result: A Real/Fake screening label, visible findings, uncalibrated model confidence, reported token usage/cost when available, and needsreview: true. Unsampled video moments are not assessed.","Cost protection: Configure a hard key spending limit and model allowlist in OpenRouter before public use. The application's in-memory IP limiter is not a billing cap.","The existing response includes a provisional 0–1 visual screening score. Metadata observations are shown as context but contribute zero to this score: missing EXIF, square dimensions, editing software, changed…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adimalkar/multimodal-fraud-detector/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"4e855fa8aaab669649413efcbd62442f60e66cad2119c750770ba366bc7b996d","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:45.878Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:45.878Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"FraudSight AI is an in-progress visual evidence screening application for images, PDFs, and videos. The backend samples bounded visual inputs, sends one request to an OpenRouter vision model, and combines its provisional result with extracted metadata. A model verdict is not proof of AI generation or insurance fraud; every result requires human review.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adimalkar/multimodal-fraud-detector/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Cost protection: Configure a hard key spending limit and model allowlist in OpenRouter before public use.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adimalkar/multimodal-fraud-detector/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"4e855fa8